SpendSigil::preCheck
├── given the config was never initialized
│   └── it should revert with PolicyNotInitialized
└── given a configured (id, account) over a live token
    ├── when it snapshots the balance and an outflow then occurs
    │   └── postCheck should meter the balance delta against the snapshot
    └── when a second execution is bracketed in the same tx
        └── it should re-snapshot the balance so the prior snapshot does not leak
